# Definition of done (Idle Party)

Before telling the owner a coding task is finished:

1. **Analyze** — `flutter analyze lib test --no-fatal-infos` clean (or stop-hook did).
2. **Tests that match** — combat/kit → share-fast / gate; What’s New / version →
   `changelog_sync_test`; hub / chase / guides → `ship_smoke_test`.
3. **Honesty** — player-visible copy matches reality (English in-game).
4. **Legal** — no foreign dumps; art via Kenney/custom helpers only.
5. **Git (one truth)** — when analyze/tests are green, **commit locally** (no
   “ska jag commita?”). Short test list; wait for play notes. **APK only if
   asked.** Ask once before push / PR / tag / Play. Never push silently. Never
   point players at GitHub Releases.
6. **Docs** — if architecture / Ascend / world path / distribution / tooling
   changed, update `AGENTS.md` (or `/init`).

Skip heavy mid-band sims unless the task is balance. Skip A56 for pure logic
unless UI chrome changed.
